    {
      "text": "Lord watch between me and thee, Gen. 31:49. set a watch against them day and night, Neh. 4:9. appoint watches of the inhabitants of Jerusalem, Neh. 7:3. wicked watcheth the righteous, Ps. 37:32. thousand years … as a watch in the night, Ps. 90:4. all that watch for iniquity are cut off, Isa. 29:20 (2 Ne. 27:31). so will I watch over them, Jer. 31:28. watch the way, Nahum 2:1. I will stand upon my watch … and will watch to see, Hab. 2:1.",
